    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/ed1944e743f08c635f2be450a41d0f7f.avif?t=1751013180\" width=616 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2></u></strong></h2>This idle game designed for a few inputs is perfect for playing on the side when you're actually doing something else.<br>Enjoy the ambience, listen to the music or just let Aya liven up your desktop!<br><br>Aya's stamina will also increase and she will be able to walk for longer! <br>Help her to reach her maximum performance!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/fecf9b633ec7c38e63d77e079d007958.poster.avif?t=1751013180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/fecf9b633ec7c38e63d77e079d007958.webm?t=1751013180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  Run,.. Nude!  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/4ca3d9504ce5611fb78f09f10b15e5b4.poster.avif?t=1751013180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/4ca3d9504ce5611fb78f09f10b15e5b4.webm?t=1751013180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2></u></strong><br>Aya starts running after pressing the start button.. <br>The pedometer unlocks new companions, hair colours, music and zones to enjoy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/6459a01055983802a9abcc6b824da7b0.avif?t=1751013180\" width=144 height=230 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Unlocks:</u></h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 dogs and 7 cat companions<br></li><li>8 zones<br></li><li>24 music tracks<br></li><li>4 hair colours</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>..and more!</li></ul><br><strong><i>Have Fun! &amp; Run, Run, Run...</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/0fd39cb86394ccd96fc8a1dbec447bb7.poster.avif?t=1751013180\" width=320 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/0fd39cb86394ccd96fc8a1dbec447bb7.webm?t=1751013180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/0fd39cb86394ccd96fc8a1dbec447bb7.mp4?t=1751013180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/ea7ca0a7d3a66384a79fe740393898c7.poster.avif?t=1751013180\" width=320 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/ea7ca0a7d3a66384a79fe740393898c7.webm?t=1751013180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/ea7ca0a7d3a66384a79fe740393898c7.mp4?t=1751013180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021060/extras/ff45c60a87fa2b0553ec53a3a790d649.avif?t=1751013180\" width=231 height=93 /></span>",
